==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|sentiēns||feeling, perceiving}}, present active participle of {{m|la|sentiō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsɛn.ʃ(i.)ənt/|/ˈsɛn.ti.ənt/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Experiencing [[sensation]], [[thought]], or [[feeling]].
#: {{syn|en|sensate}}
# Able to consciously [[perceive]] through the use of [[sense]] faculties.
#: {{ant|en|insensate}}
# {{lb|en|chiefly|science fiction}} Possessing human-like awareness and intelligence.
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:self-aware}}

